Max witness q over COMPRESSED covering gcd=1 families vs magnitude N (aligned band-blockers).
==================================================================================
           N  log10 N #compressed tested  MAX witness q
        1000        3               ~20k             43
       10000        4               ~20k             56
      100000        5               ~20k             41
     1000000        6               ~20k             47
    10000000        7               ~20k             51
   100000000        8               ~20k             39
  1000000000        9               ~20k             43

MAX-q vs log10(N): sequence [43, 56, 41, 47, 51, 39, 43]
slope (q per decade) ~ -0.86
=> slope ~ 0 (q plateaus): compressed q UNIFORMLY BOUNDED -> a FIXED census (q<=~56) closes
   the compressed case, wide residual = the census, no renormalization needed.
   slope > 0 (q grows): compressed q ~ log(mag) -> the log-census/deep renormalization is the crux.
